    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b7760e7585eba233f43accb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使用作战「领放」保持连胜，并在包含JBC经典赛、帝王赏、东京大赏典的\\n沙土重赏赛事(GⅠ、GⅡ和GⅢ)中取得至少9次胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "08ced1e9677ca554f480a223d97094dc1a0a86d8f71ed8dedeb35a2b982e2205",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "88"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe24f5e4d1d5985ad45befe7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "于包含短途马锦标及高松宫纪念的\\n1200m比赛中获得9胜以上，\\n并且粉丝数达到240000人以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "a771c4154608d798060d7a2ddbb58734d2ca2d46b597d7ed3bef13a09e1c2fc6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "89"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61ccac167422cd601be816d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "继承来源双方皆为在育成过程中未取得过重赏胜利的赛马娘，\\n在继承心意后取得GⅠ胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "c47a9d946e0d4d89a6d1fda1307bcbdb71d75641fd40a1f9858841be5accc017",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a33a73ceb43eb53ebae0ff77",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在草地与沙土的GⅠ级别比赛中各取得3次以上胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "5865ca2e382e7dd4a2591d9c5d18799f9b95401c71b2176491522b0de0620d4d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "90"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3e9eecb85d8af981543157b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在樱花赏、NHK英里杯、维多利亚英里赛、\\n英里冠军赛、安田纪念5场比赛中均以人气第一的状态赢得全部胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "73d63e4e88effd86f5f054f350ad6d8c3a4a5329052c9eb70bb1866b558f8005",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "91"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:558f588d618b65f0e8a2005b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "参加出道战",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac044db25dbf87c42af344eabb1a3507abfa308b118bdd0f5c7789668360a769",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "92"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4765324c36e2ab1d61ebae71",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "度过了一段宝贵的时光，感受到了不可替代的牵绊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce5a7fc9d11f88e987688b18be13bc9d4babd399db96fe7b1c391f691e8b1086",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "97"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68c76a6e4a0503efeb836012",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在URA总决赛中获胜",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb52107c276304f975ad858eda7302dde1734f16a0f6b27cdd2c9058900b2fc9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "98"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5424d38ae3f6b1de1641da66",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "取得樱花赏、日本橡树大赛、秋华赏的胜利",
